#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Nom d'affichage"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_affiliate_key
msgid ""
"From Developer settings in the SumUp dashboard. The key allows a list of "
"application identifiers, and the POS runs in a browser rather than in an "
"application of yours, so that list has to include the browser: on iOS the "
"SumUp app reports the caller as com.sumup.appswitch, whatever the URL says. "
"Add it to the key beside your own identifier."
msgstr ""
"Disponible dans les paramètres développeur du tableau de bord SumUp. La clé "
"autorise une liste d'identifiants d'application, et le point de vente "
"s'exécute dans un navigateur et non dans une application qui vous appartient"
" : cette liste doit donc inclure le navigateur. Sur iOS, l'application SumUp"
" déclare l'appelant comme com.sumup.appswitch, quelle que soit l'URL. "
"Ajoutez cet identifiant à la clé, à côté du vôtre."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/static/src/payment_sumup.js:0
msgid "Only an order that was paid with SumUp can be refunded to SumUp."
msgstr "Seule une commande réglée avec SumUp peut être remboursée via SumUp."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model,name:mb_pos_sumup.model_pos_payment_method
msgid "Point of Sale Payment Methods"
msgstr "Modes de paiement du point de vente"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_skip_success_screen
msgid ""
"Return to the POS as soon as the card is approved instead of waiting for the"
" cashier to dismiss SumUp's own screen."
msgstr ""
"Revenir au point de vente dès que la carte est acceptée, au lieu d'attendre "
"que le caissier ferme l'écran de SumUp."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_app_id
msgid ""
"Sent as the app-id parameter, which only Android reads. iOS takes no such "
"parameter and derives the caller itself - see the affiliate key above. Use "
"an identifier registered on the key."
msgstr ""
"Envoyé comme paramètre app-id, que seul Android lit. iOS n'accepte pas ce "
"paramètre et déduit lui-même l'appelant : voir la clé d'affiliation ci-"
"dessus. Utilisez un identifiant enregistré sur la clé."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Set an enabled SumUp account for the same company on payment method %s."
msgstr ""
"Renseignez un compte SumUp activé, appartenant à la même société, sur le "
"mode de paiement %s."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"Set the SumUp affiliate key on the payment method %s before taking a payment"
" with it."
msgstr ""
"Renseignez la clé d'affiliation SumUp sur le mode de paiement %s avant de "
"l'utiliser pour encaisser."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_skip_success_screen
msgid "Skip SumUp Success Screen"
msgstr "Ignorer l'écran de confirmation SumUp"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_payment_provider_id
msgid "SumUp Account"
msgstr "Compte SumUp"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_affiliate_key
msgid "SumUp Affiliate Key"
msgstr "Clé d'affiliation SumUp"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_app_id
msgid "SumUp App ID"
msgstr "Identifiant d'application SumUp"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/static/src/payment_sumup.js:0
msgid "SumUp Error"
msgstr "Erreur SumUp"

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid "SumUp has no record of the payment to refund."
msgstr "SumUp n'a aucune trace du paiement à rembourser."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid "SumUp has no record of this payment."
msgstr "SumUp n'a aucune trace de ce paiement."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/static/src/payment_sumup.js:0
msgid "SumUp refused the payment."
msgstr "SumUp a refusé le paiement."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/static/src/payment_sumup.js:0
msgid "SumUp refused the refund."
msgstr "SumUp a refusé le remboursement."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid "SumUp reported this payment as %s."
msgstr "SumUp a signalé ce paiement comme %s."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/static/src/overrides/pos_store.js:0
msgid "SumUp returned a payment that matches no open order."
msgstr ""
"SumUp a renvoyé un paiement qui ne correspond à aucune commande ouverte."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid ""
"SumUp returned payment evidence for a different reference, currency, or "
"merchant account."
msgstr ""
"SumUp a renvoyé un justificatif de paiement portant sur une autre référence,"
" une autre devise ou un autre compte marchand."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid "SumUp took %(charged)s for this payment, not %(expected)s."
msgstr "SumUp a encaissé %(charged)s pour ce paiement, et non %(expected)s."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mb_pos_sumup.field_pos_payment_method__sumup_payment_provider_id
msgid ""
"The SumUp account used to verify a payment against SumUp's own records and "
"to refund it. It is mandatory: callback URL parameters are never accepted as"
" payment evidence."
msgstr ""
"Le compte SumUp utilisé pour vérifier un paiement auprès des enregistrements"
" de SumUp et pour le rembourser. Il est obligatoire : les paramètres d'URL "
"de retour ne sont jamais acceptés comme justificatif de paiement."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/static/src/payment_sumup.js:0
msgid ""
"The SumUp app did not open. Install it on this device, or record the payment"
" another way."
msgstr ""
"L'application SumUp ne s'est pas ouverte. Installez-la sur cet appareil ou "
"enregistrez le paiement autrement."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid "The SumUp callback must return to this Odoo instance."
msgstr "L'URL de retour SumUp doit pointer vers cette instance Odoo."

#. module: mb_pos_sumup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_pos_sumup/models/pos_payment_method.py:0
msgid "The payment identifier is too long for SumUp."
msgstr "L'identifiant de paiement est trop long pour SumUp."
